    "title": "BYUI CAN kickoff launches new student and mentorship networking - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emma Bloomfield ,\n5 hours ago The College of Business and Communication’s Executive Student Board launched the first official event for its new Career Advancement Network, known as CAN, last Thursday. The Executive Student Board for the College of Business and Communication formed this August, but was in the works much earlier. Brother Harrell, Associate Dean of Student Success, as well as President Brock Neiderer and Vice President Taven Chamberlain, supervised the interviewing process to select student representatives for each department within the college. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
